6980","ru":"Полярные противоположности","en":"Polar Opposites","year":"2025","type":"Фильм","rating":7.2,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/155X36JZ1KLoXjHfF4DNXV8Yt57.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ouvxGRtKkR6VkFzvmz4da8Ppa9R.jpg","genres":["Телевизионный фильм","Комедия","Мелодрама"],"overview":"Эмме нужно добраться до Антарктиды, чтобы встретиться со своим отцом, и она отправляется в Южную Америку, но у неё не получается попасть на последний рейс нужного ей корабля. Она тайком пробирается на круизный лайнер и встречает там инженера Энди.","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1451078","ru":"రాకాస","en":"రాకాస","year":"2026","type":"Фильм","rating":7.2,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/vJLH4bGnKfCCbJl0rGf2oEnKEbL.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hxCJcyDnR964ja5mzExvb8UlHLG.jpg","genres":["Фэнтези","Комедия"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1064205","ru":"대가족","en":"대가족","year":"2024","type":"Фильм","rating":7.2,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9PNcTHx1TiESlzqmgjHKgpy2ARP.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qdl3SlctJM72sUbv8zo2UjHoIpv.jpg","genres":["Драма","Комедия"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"937323","ru":"പ്രിയന്‍ ഓട്ടത്തിലാണ്","en":"പ്രിയന്‍ ഓട്ടത്തിലാണ്","year":"2022","type":"Фильм","rating":7.2,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2gOHHVU4TYV3eQgMp5UQRVcb4bb.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mlJTBVqDvlHqBTbozHRT4MpSpRB.jpg","genres":["Комедия","Семейный"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1007028","ru":"Kendrick Lamar Live: The Big Steppers Tour","en":"Kendrick Lamar Live: The Big Steppers Tour","year":"2022","type":"Фильм","rating":7.2,"votes":9,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2o2xNyQiInK4ze9sOQ5pbGEp